msgid "Select assessment year"
msgstr "Select assessment year"

msgid ""
"Use the year selector to choose the assessment year. Typically you will be "
"assessing data from the previous calendar year."
msgstr ""
"Use the year selector to choose the assessment year. Typically you will be "
"assessing data from the previous calendar year."

msgid "Navigate to assessment"
msgstr "Navigate to assessment"

msgid ""
"Click Regional Assessment in the sidebar to enter regional data, or "
"District Assessment for district-level assessment."
msgstr ""
"Click Regional Assessment in the sidebar to enter regional data, or "
"District Assessment for district-level assessment."

msgid "Select your region or district"
msgstr "Select your region or district"

msgid ""
"Choose your region from the dropdown. For district assessment, also select "
"the district. The form loads any previously saved data and auto-populates "
"available DHIS2 indicators."
msgstr ""
"Choose your region from the dropdown. For district assessment, also select "
"the district. The form loads any previously saved data and auto-populates "
"available DHIS2 indicators."

msgid "Enter indicator values"
msgstr "Enter indicator values"

msgid ""
"Work through each objective tab, entering current year and previous year "
"values for all 94 indicators. Scores are calculated as you type."
msgstr ""
"Work through each objective tab, entering current year and previous year "
"values for all 94 indicators. Scores are calculated as you type."

msgid "Complete milestones"
msgstr "Complete milestones"

msgid ""
"For each objective, mark the milestone achievement and provide evidence. "
"Milestones carry a quarter of the objective weight."
msgstr ""
"For each objective, mark the milestone achievement and provide evidence. "
"Milestones carry a quarter of the objective weight."

msgid "Save and submit"
msgstr "Save and submit"

msgid ""
"Save frequently using Save Draft. Once at least 80% complete, click Submit "
"for Review to send it to your peer reviewer."
msgstr ""
"Save frequently using Save Draft. Once at least 80% complete, click Submit "
"for Review to send it to your peer reviewer."

