msgstr "Permissions"

msgid "Auto-save"
msgstr "Auto-save"

msgid ""
"The system saves your work every 30 seconds while you are editing, and "
"shows an \"Auto-saved\" timestamp. You can also save manually at any time. "
"It is still worth saving before navigating away."
msgstr ""
"The system saves your work every 30 seconds while you are editing, and "
"shows an \"Auto-saved\" timestamp. You can also save manually at any time. "
"It is still worth saving before navigating away."

