"For indicators marked Manual, enter current and previous year values from "
"your records, reports or registers."
msgstr ""
"For indicators marked Manual, enter current and previous year values from "
"your records, reports or registers."

msgid ""
"For each objective, assess the milestone status and provide supporting "
"evidence."
msgstr ""
"For each objective, assess the milestone status and provide supporting "
"evidence."

msgid "Save and review"
msgstr "Save and review"

msgid ""
"Save as draft and check the summary panel for your overall score, objective "
"scores and completion."
msgstr ""
"Save as draft and check the summary panel for your overall score, objective "
"scores and completion."

msgid "No data penalty"
msgstr "No data penalty"

msgid ""
"Any indicator left without data automatically scores -2, which lowers the "
"overall assessment substantially. If data is not supplied it is assumed the "
"region or district has not provided the required information. Always enter "
"all available data before submitting."
msgstr ""
"Any indicator left without data automatically scores -2, which lowers the "
"overall assessment substantially. If data is not supplied it is assumed the "
"region or district has not provided the required information. Always enter "
"all available data before submitting."

msgid "Phase 2 — Submission (owner)"
msgstr "Phase 2 — Submission (owner)"

msgid "Click Submit for Review on the assessment page."
msgstr "Click Submit for Review on the assessment page."

msgid "The status changes from Draft to Submitted."
msgstr "The status changes from Draft to Submitted."

msgid ""
"The assessment locks — the owner cannot edit further until the review is "
"resolved."
msgstr ""
"The assessment locks — the owner cannot edit further until the review is "
"resolved."

msgid "The paired reviewer can now open it."
msgstr "The paired reviewer can now open it."

msgid "Phase 3 — Peer review (visiting reviewer)"
msgstr "Phase 3 — Peer review (visiting reviewer)"

msgid ""
"The reviewer does not enter or modify data. They review what was submitted "
"and give feedback. Reviews auto-save every 30 seconds, and at least 80% of "
"rows must be verified before submitting."
msgstr ""
"The reviewer does not enter or modify data. They review what was submitted "
"and give feedback. Reviews auto-save every 30 seconds, and at least 80% of "
"rows must be verified before submitting."

