msgid "How scores are weighted"
msgstr "How scores are weighted"

msgid ""
"Each indicator carries a weight derived from expert scoring. Within an "
"objective, an indicator contributes its share of that objective weight."
msgstr ""
"Each indicator carries a weight derived from expert scoring. Within an "
"objective, an indicator contributes its share of that objective weight."

msgid ""
"The milestone for each objective carries 25% of that objective weight, so "
"it moves the score more than any single indicator."
msgstr ""
"The milestone for each objective carries 25% of that objective weight, so "
"it moves the score more than any single indicator."

