"The assessment is organised into 3 strategic objectives aligned with the "
"Health Sector Medium-Term Development Plan (HSMTDP). Each objective carries "
"its own indicators and one milestone."
msgstr ""
"The assessment is organised into 3 strategic objectives aligned with the "
"Health Sector Medium-Term Development Plan (HSMTDP). Each objective carries "
