msgid "You need the GHS_ASSESSMENT"
msgstr "You need the GHS_ASSESSMENT_ADMIN authority to configure the assessment."

msgctxt ""
"EDIT authority, so this assessment is read-only. Contact your DHIS2 "
"administrator to request edit access."
msgid "You do not have the GHS_ASSESSMENT"
msgstr ""
"You do not have the GHS_ASSESSMENT_EDIT authority, so this assessment is "
"read-only. Contact your DHIS2 administrator to request edit access."

msgctxt ""
"EDIT authority in DHIS2. Users without it see assessments read-only. "
"Contact your DHIS2 administrator if you need edit access."
msgid "To edit an assessment you need the GHS_ASSESSMENT"
msgstr ""
"To edit an assessment you need the GHS_ASSESSMENT_EDIT authority in DHIS2. "
"Users without it see assessments read-only. Contact your DHIS2 "
"administrator if you need edit access."

msgctxt ""
"EDIT authority, or the assessment has been submitted and is locked pending "
"peer review."
msgid "Either you lack the GHS_ASSESSMENT"
msgstr ""
"Either you lack the GHS_ASSESSMENT_EDIT authority, or the assessment has "
"been submitted and is locked pending peer review."

msgctxt ""
"ADMIN. Grant them to the relevant roles in the Users app; the app install "
"creates all three authorities."
msgid ""
"No user role on this instance carries GHS_ASSESSMENT_EDIT, GHS_PEER_REVIEW "
"or GHS_ASSESSMENT"
msgstr ""
"No user role on this instance carries GHS_ASSESSMENT_EDIT, GHS_PEER_REVIEW "
"or GHS_ASSESSMENT_ADMIN. Grant them to the relevant roles in the Users app; "
"the app install creates all three authorities."

